<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>IIS on Leo Sheu 的日常筆記</title><link>https://blog.leosheu.com/categories/iis/</link><description>Recent content in IIS on Leo Sheu 的日常筆記</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 02 Sep 2021 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.leosheu.com/categories/iis/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>如何查詢 w3wp.exe 對應的 IIS Application Pool</title><link>https://blog.leosheu.com/p/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2-w3wp.exe-%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E7%9A%84-iis-application-pool/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Sep 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.leosheu.com/p/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2-w3wp.exe-%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E7%9A%84-iis-application-pool/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;on Windows 2012 (IIS 8)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;選擇想要檢視的 IIS Worker Process&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="378px" data-flex-grow="157" height="412" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.leosheu.com/p/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2-w3wp.exe-%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E7%9A%84-iis-application-pool/w3wp-1.png" width="650"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;切到 detail 查看該 process 的 PID&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="436px" data-flex-grow="182" height="357" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.leosheu.com/p/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2-w3wp.exe-%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E7%9A%84-iis-application-pool/w3wp-2.png" width="650"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;切換到 C:\Windows\System32\inetsrv ，執行 &lt;code&gt;.\appcmd.exe list wp&lt;/code&gt; 找到對應的 PID&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="473px" data-flex-grow="197" height="343" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.leosheu.com/p/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2-w3wp.exe-%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E7%9A%84-iis-application-pool/w3wp-3.png" width="677"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>